    "introHtml": "<p>The complete terminology review: prefixes, roots, and suffixes, directional terms and body planes, the eleven body systems, and the abbreviations that are safe to use — and the ones that are not.</p><p>All content in this guide is original review material for exam preparation. It is educational content only, not medical advice. There is no national exam or certification attached to the terminology exam in this course — it is a knowledge check that makes every other part of the capstone easier.</p>",
